# Advanced 9-ball rail-first safety: contact the legal 6 after a cushion and hide the cue behind the 8.
# Instructional source: https://drdavepoolinfo.com/cb_articles/2018/april18.pdf
# Validation contract: cue contacts right cushion before 6; no ball drops; 8 blocks the final cue-to-6 line.
table brunswick_gc4_9ft
game nine_ball
ball cue at (2.4000, 3.2000)
ball six at (3.7500, 5.5000)
ball eight at (2.3000, 7.2700)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.1)
trace(max_events: 30)
shot(cue).heading(40deg).speed(58ips).tip(side: 0.0R, height: 0.05R).using(default)
